exclam: take the UK/6.1 second scan item

6.1's exclam_phrase pushes a second scan item (type 3) into the
phrase record and marks it kind 2, right after the type 5 item it
shares with 4.3. The UK module still carries that block; the US one
was flattened. Without it a final '!' renders with the same contour
as a '.'

